# Philips TV Remote (RC5 and RC5X protocols)
# RC5: 5-bit address, 6-bit command (0x00-0x3F)
# RC5X: 5-bit address, 7-bit command (0x40-0x7F extended range)
# Philips TV address = 0x00
# 
